realnavmemory counterfactual --input CSV --model BUNDLE_JSON --out-dir NEW
Erases only pre-relocation model-visible stimulus; reports every test pair.
Fixed reporting scale: 1e-6 cm. Errors: invalid source, model, boundary, cancellation or existing output.
Example: realnavmemory counterfactual --input /data/trials.csv.gz --model /data/bundle.json --out-dir /data/counterfactual
